# Large / generated / local-only: `npm run build:circuit` recreates everything here. Development and intermediate zkeys, ptau files, witnesses and R1CS files are NEVER committed.
# The ONE intentionally version-controlled zkey is the final prototype ceremony's (see the exception at the end).
node_modules/
artifacts/
*.ptau
*.zkey
*.wtns
*.r1cs
*.sym
# EXCEPTION: the FINAL PROTOTYPE ceremony's zkey cannot be rebuilt (its entropy is gone by design), so this ONE file is committed; its SHA-256 is pinned in spec/final-ceremony.json
!ceremony/ballot_validity_final.zkey
